<% content_for :title, "Privacy & your details" %>
<section class="page-intro narrow prose">
  <p class="eyebrow">The pilot</p><h1>Privacy &<br><em>your details.</em></h1>
  <p>Commonbound is an early pilot run by Monika, Sarper and Duncan. We collect the details you submit so we can review your interest, ask follow-up questions and suggest relevant introductions.</p>
  <h2>Who can see what you share?</h2>
  <p>Submissions are private by default. The team reviews them in a protected admin area. With your permission, we can publish a profile with your answers and website. Your contact email, pay expectations and team review notes stay private. We ask both sides before sharing details for an introduction.</p>
  <h2>What do we store?</h2>
  <p>Your form answers, contact details, submission date and permission to contact you. We may add private notes about conversations and introductions. Please leave out confidential information and other people's personal details.</p>
  <p>The app and its database are hosted on Fly.io. We use an essential session cookie for form security. We don't use advertising cookies or analytics trackers.</p>
  <h2>Changes or removal</h2>
  <p>To update or remove your submission, contact the team member who invited you, or reply to a message from us. Please use the email address you submitted so we can verify the request.</p>
  <p>We keep submissions while we run this pilot and review whether they are still needed when it ends. We won't publish your answers without your permission or add you to a marketing mailing list. You can ask the team to take your public profile down.</p>
  <p><%= link_to "Back to Commonbound", root_path %></p>
</section>
